<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel should requote Tuesday - source.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel should requote Tuesday - source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Eurotunnel SA/Plc should resume by next Tuesday at the latest, a source close to the company's debt restructuring talks said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Once Eurotunnel's board and the 24 &quot;instructing banks&quot; in the bank syndicate have approved details of the company's debt refinancing, and the information has appeared in the public domain, the shares should &quot;requote Monday or Tuesday. Tuesday by the latest,&quot; said the source, who declined to be named.</p>
</text>
